       false, true, timestamptz '2026-02-05 12:15:00+05:30'),
      ('Aegis Drone Systems',
       'Drone inspection for ports, transmission lines and plantation estates. Based in Kochi, Kerala.',
       'Good pilots, good imagery, no repeat business. Every rupee so far has come from one off inspections, and DGCA BVLOS permissions were still pending when we met. Inspection only becomes a business when it becomes a retainer. Revisit when at least three sites are on annual contracts and BVLOS clearance is granted.',
       false, true, timestamptz '2026-04-18 15:25:00+05:30'),
      ('Kadal Systems',
       'Satellite messaging and distress alerts for small fishing vessels. Based in Kollam, Kerala.',
